yml, update_seed_cycles at lifecycle/mod.rs:404.","Containment independently re-proven, not taken from the report: merge-base(origin/denkhaus, upstream/main) = 2f326a13c = upstream tip; rev-list delta = 0; fork lead = 550; code diff 9613ec4d8→6931cf92c excluding .fabro is empty. e457feb9f is single-parent (report+journal only) — a true no-op.","ADR-0019 capability scan executed against the upstream-contributed delta, which is provably empty (0 commits): no credential/sandbox/tool-catalog/permission-surface changes, therefore no hits and no needs-user seeds filed. Scan basis documented here rather than silently skipped.","Obsolescence: impossible this pass — upstream has not moved since the 2026-09-06 merge of 2f326a13c; no open seed can be superseded by a zero delta. Standing watchlist (SQLite read-model, RunIntent admission matrix, node-on-failure exclusion, fabro-b7c4 upstream PR offer) unchanged.","Evidence accepted without gate rerun per review contract: report table shows just qualitygate green in its documented zero-diff degraded mode plus fresh touchpoint probes (finalize 26/26, seed_cycles 4/4, publish_blocked 2/2, fabro-github 92/92, pull_request 55/55) — stronger than the prior no-op pass's grep-only evidence. Review took ~5 minutes."]}}
